# C080: Valid hash -1 collides with the empty-slot sentinel on 32-bit
#
# CONFIRMED — static analysis (NULL dereference / portability, 32-bit only)
#
# The DJB2 hash is narrowed to Py_hash_t (statementcache.c:84-85).  On 32-bit,
# 0xffffffff becomes -1, the initialized empty marker.  Lookup compares hash
# before checking the cache pointer and dereferences NULL (statementcache.c:166-220).
# Valid SQL strings can produce that hash.  Not reproducible on 64-bit where
# Py_hash_t is 64-bit.
